(vector (map (:db/id -1)
  (:adr/id "adr-2607279500-remaining-4-service-binding-xrpc-sdk")
  (:adr/doc_type "adr")
  (:adr/topic "datomic-client-api")
  (:adr/title "ADR-2607279500: Remaining-4 — Service Binding, XRPC policy, Cognitect harness, SDK /api/*")
  (:adr/status "accepted")
  (:adr/date "2026-07-27")
  (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-27")
  (:adr/superseded-by "adr-2607279600-closing-slo-cognitect-session")
  (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki"))
  (:adr/authoritative true)
  (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "KOTOBASE_XRPC_DATOMIC off|legacy|on"
   "Service Binding KOTOBASE_D1 for edge→D1 p50"
   "SDK POST /api/* Client API transport"
   "Cognitect synthetic harness expansion (not wire golden)"))
  (:adr/repos (vector "gftdcojp/net-kotobase" "kotoba-lang/kotobase-storage-d1"))
  (:adr/related (vector "adr-2607279400-datomic-gaps-1-2-3-closure"
   "adr-2607279000-kotobase-datomic-client-api-maturity"
   "adr-2607279100-client-api-edge-d1-bridge"))
  (:adr/body "## Context

Residual four after dual-path + SLO (ADR-2607279400):

1. XRPC datomic hard-disable
2. p50 (edge→D1 public HTTPS hop)
3. Cognitect wire harness
4. SDK still XRPC-primary

## Decision

### 1. KOTOBASE_XRPC_DATOMIC ∈ off | legacy | on

- off → datomic.* XRPC returns 410 Gone + prefer POST /api/*
- legacy (default) → serve with Deprecation/Sunset 2026-11-01
- on → serve without deprecation pressure

### 2. Service Binding KOTOBASE_D1 → kotobase-storage-d1

proxy/d1-fetch + client_api proxy use env.KOTOBASE_D1.fetch when bound;
fallback public KOTOBASE_D1_URL. Header x-kotobase-d1-transport:
service-binding | public-https. Primary p50 lever for /api/* and XRPC
datomic bridge.

### 3. Cognitect harness

Expanded synthetic Transit fixtures + scripts/cognitect-wire-check.cljc.
captured/ empty until owner Cloud MITM. Shape-compatible only — not
client-cloud wire golden.

### 4. SDK rewrite

kotobase.sdk.client implements POST /api/* EDN Client API. Facade
re-exports q/transact/pull/datoms/db/tx-range/with/qseq/connect.
README preferred surface is /api/* not XRPC.

## Consequences

Flip KOTOBASE_XRPC_DATOMIC=off after clients migrate. Service binding
requires stable Worker name kotobase-storage-d1. Cognitect live golden
remains owner-blocked.

## Closing note (2026-07-27)

Auth-path SLO re-qualify (edge Service Binding + D1 direct) green — see
ADR-2607279600 and evidence EDN under both repos. Cognitect wire still
owner-blocked (shape only). This ADR remains accepted for remaining-4
design; session handoff is ADR-2607279600.
")))
